      "about": "I believe technology creates its greatest value when it brings together people, organizations and ecosystems around a shared ambition.Whether working with customers, governments, partners or executive teams, my focus has remained the same: creating environments where innovation, collaboration and disciplined execution reinforce one another to deliver lasting impact.Most recently, I have had the privilege of contributing to Lenovo’s strategic growth in Saudi Arabia, supporting one of the company’s most significant transformation initiatives through the partnership with PIF and ALAT. The journey spans manufacturing localization, Regional Headquarters establishment, ecosystem development, AI infrastructure positioning and industry transformation aligned with Vision 2030.Over more than 25 years of executive leadership across EMEA, LATAM, MEE, GCC and Central Asia, I have helped organizations grow from market entry to multi-billion-dollar scale across enterprise software, cloud, infrastructure and AI-driven platforms.Today, my work continues to focus on helping organizations translate strategic ambition into scalable execution across AI, enterprise platforms, sovereign digital transformation and ecosystem-led growth.I enjoy working where strategic vision and disciplined execution come together—building high-performing international teams, strengthening trusted partnerships and helping organizations navigate complex transformation with confidence.Current focus: AI Infrastructure • Enterprise Platforms • Sovereign Digital Transformation • Ecosystem-led GrowthAll views expressed are my own.",
